# Secrets for `uv run python -m src ...` and `make run`. Copy this file to .env and fill it in:
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored and never goes into the Docker image, so your key stays on your machine.
# Variables set in the environment win over it. Everything else (model, backend) is configured in
# conf/, see conf/config.yaml. No Hugging Face token is needed: the dataset and the local Ollama
# model are public. Write the values without quotes: `make run` hands this file to Docker as it is.

# CSCS Inference API key (for the models in conf/model/ with `backend: cscs`), created at
# https://ui.inference.cscs.ch under the resource director2-g238-inference-4. At the evaluation,
# the organisers set their own key under the same name.
API_KEY=

# The endpoint of that key, if not the CSCS Inference API, which is the default
# BASE_URL=https://api.inference.cscs.ch/v1
